{
  "key": 18239,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Yahoo",
      "en_US": "Yahoo!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_IGotSomethingCool",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "I got something cool.\n",
        "I’ll show you as a special favor!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_CheckOutTheRuins",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh?\n",
        "What the...\r",
        "What’s this all about?\r",
        "...I got some Seals, but I forgot to\n",
        "put them on.\r",
        "Oh, right.\n",
        "It’s because I was at the ruins.\r",
        "The ruins here are cool.\n",
        "You have to check it out.\r",
        "I even found a Hidden Machine.\n",
        "It was Defog!\r",
        "Anyway, I’ll battle you another time.\n",
        "See ya!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_BreathingInRefreshingAir",
      "en_US": [
        "Breathing in this refreshing air...\n",
        "It perks up Pokémon, don’t you think?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_TakeItEasy",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, traveling Trainer.\n",
        "Take it easy, slow, and casual."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_TakeATour",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, traveling Trainer.\n",
        "There’s nothing here.\r",
        "Well, nothing but plenty of time to\n",
        "think, anyway.\r",
        "Oh, right. We have the ruins here.\n",
        "Why not take a tour through that?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_ImTooLittle",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m too little, so I don’t know\n",
        "how to battle very good.\r",
        "The nice Day-Care Lady is raising\n",
        "my Pokémon for me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_IVisitTheLostTower",
      "en_US": [
        "Every Sunday, I visit the Lost\n",
        "Tower..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_UsedToBeNothing",
      "en_US": [
        "There used to be nothing here but\n",
        "a road that went straight through.\r",
        "Over time, Pokémon and people just\n",
        "gathered, and the town came to be."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_IfCompetentMetFiftyPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "A traveling Trainer, huh?\r",
        "Tell me, how many kinds of Pokémon\n",
        "have you met so far?\r",
        "If you’re a competent Trainer, I’d\n",
        "think you’d’ve met at least fifty.\r",
        "If you haven’t, go farther abroad and\n",
        "search wider, youngster."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_PoketchAppPokemonHistory",
      "en_US": [
        "Your encounters with Pokémon can\n",
        "be considered your shared history.\r",
        "This here’s a Pokétch app called\n",
        "Pokémon History.\r",
        "Use it to see your history of\n",
        "Pokémon catches.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_EachPokemonOwnHistory",
      "en_US": [
        "You have your history, and each\n",
        "Pokémon has its own history.\r",
        "When the two collide, new drama\n",
        "is born."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_MapSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Solaceon Town\n",
        "Free of Worry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SignPokemonDayCare",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Day Care\n",
        "Let Us Raise Your Pokémon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SignPokemonNewsPress",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon News Press\n",
        "Wanted: Pro Pokémon Catcher!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2WallPhotos",
      "en_US": [
        "A wall of photos. Each card has a\n",
        "name, a date and a place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2WallPonyta",
      "en_US": [
        "A child's drawing of a man and a\n",
        "Ponyta.\r",
        "The card gives her name, her\n",
        "birthday, and where it happened."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2WallElias",
      "en_US": [
        "A card: ELIAS. VALOR BASIN.\r",
        "No one signed for it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2WallBanner",
      "en_US": [
        "A banner, pinned above the wall:\r",
        "WHO DID YOU LOSE?\n",
        "Team Eclipse"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2WallTeo",
      "en_US": [
        "A new card: TEO. A boy, smiling.\n",
        "The pin is still shiny."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2IndraAnotherName",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Another name today.\n",
        "A boy from Floaroma.\r",
        "His dad cried the whole time.\n",
        "I wrote it all down anyway.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2IndraSomebodyHasTo",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Somebody has to.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2IndraMorningDoor",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Saros wants a morning.\n",
        "Kahn wants a door.\r",
        "I don't care which one works, Teo.\r",
        "Either one brings you home.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2IndraHandsShake",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Saros's hands shake now.\n",
        "Kahn doesn't sleep.\r",
        "The shards are taking something\n",
        "out of them.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Arc2IndraKeepTheDoor",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: So I keep the door.\r",
        "Nobody gets through who could\n",
        "break it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_QuestsRowanBanner",
      "en_US": [
        "A banner stamped with a black sun:\r",
        "EVEN PROFESSOR ROWAN SAYS IT\n",
        "MAY BE POSSIBLE.\r",
        "WHO DID YOU LOSE?\n",
        "Team Eclipse"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTentClerkA_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome. Are you here to register\n",
        "someone?\r",
        "Take your time. Nobody here is in\n",
        "a hurry."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTentClerkA_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Name, date, and place. That's all\n",
        "we ask.\r",
        "Some people talk for an hour.\n",
        "I write it all down."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimFatherA",
      "en_US": [
        "I've seen you before. On the road\n",
        "to Jubilife, I think.\r",
        "I brought her drawing all this\n",
        "way. It's on the wall now.\r",
        "Right in the middle. The Ponyta\n",
        "one. She'd like that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimSailorA",
      "en_US": [
        "Third time in this line. I keep\n",
        "getting to the front\r",
        "and walking away.\r",
        "How do you write down a Machoke\n",
        "who hated boats?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimSisterA",
      "en_US": [
        "They asked how old he was.\r",
        "I said nineteen. Then I said he's\n",
        "still nineteen.\r",
        "The lady wrote that down too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimSonA",
      "en_US": [
        "I'm putting up the thumb photo.\r",
        "It's the only one with any of\n",
        "Mom in it. Half a thumb counts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolRoadGreeterA",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to Solaceon! Here, take a\n",
        "flyer.\r",
        "WHO DID YOU LOSE?\r",
        "You don't have to answer. Most\n",
        "people don't, the first time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolWallWidowA",
      "en_US": [
        "That card at the top is my\n",
        "husband's. First one up.\r",
        "Every morning I come and say hello.\r",
        "The Sanctuary people bring me tea.\n",
        "They're so kind here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGardenGirlA",
      "en_US": [
        "There are Yamask in the grass.\r",
        "Grandma says each one carries a\n",
        "face. The face of who it was.\r",
        "I keep looking for Grandpa's."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolLanternManA",
      "en_US": [
        "Now it's lanterns. I light one for\n",
        "every new card.\r",
        "I've run out of oil twice this\n",
        "month."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBelieverMotherA",
      "en_US": [
        "My boy would be about your age.\r",
        "Team Eclipse says he can come home.\n",
        "Not a memory. Him.\r",
        "I know how that sounds. I don't\n",
        "care how it sounds."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGateGreeterA",
      "en_US": [
        "The Sanctuary is open to everyone.\n",
        "Come in, sit, stay as long as\r",
        "you like.\r",
        "Nobody in there will tell you to\n",
        "move on."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolForecourtSweeperA",
      "en_US": [
        "The black sun in the paving. That's\n",
        "the eclipse.\r",
        "The sun goes dark for a while, and\n",
        "then it comes back.\r",
        "That's the whole idea, they told\n",
        "me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolDigWorkerA",
      "en_US": [
        "The Sanctuary hired a few of us to\n",
        "dig. Pays well.\r",
        "We clear the first room. The deep\n",
        "rooms are for their own people.\r",
        "Lot of crates for an old ruin."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolRuinManiacA",
      "en_US": [
        "They fenced off MY ruins!\r",
        "I've been digging a tunnel out of\n",
        "there for years. Years!\r",
        "Now I need a pass to visit my own\n",
        "tunnel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolKennelKeeperA",
      "en_US": [
        "Their trainers passed away, so the\n",
        "Sanctuary takes them in.\r",
        "I feed them, brush them, tell them\n",
        "their names.\r",
        "Every week a truck comes and takes\n",
        "some to new homes. In the city."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolRancherA",
      "en_US": [
        "Busy season. Pilgrims all week.\r",
        "They all stop and watch the\n",
        "Buneary. I think it helps."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolSundayManA",
      "en_US": [
        "My wife's grave is up there.\r",
        "The rest of the week, I come to the\n",
        "wall. It's closer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolDoubterA",
      "en_US": [
        "My wife's card is on that wall.\n",
        "I put it there myself.\r",
        "I just keep wondering who pays for\n",
        "all of this.\r",
        "Hope doesn't run trucks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTentClerkB",
      "en_US": [
        "There are guards now. Did you see?\r",
        "Someone broke into our depot in\n",
        "Veilstone. Thieves.\r",
        "Who steals from a place like this?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimFatherB",
      "en_US": [
        "I meant to go home after I pinned\n",
        "it up.\r",
        "I keep finding reasons to stay one\n",
        "more day."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolWallWidowB",
      "en_US": [
        "They've put guards at the gate.\n",
        "Young ones. In robes.\r",
        "One of them carried my chair to the\n",
        "wall this morning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolLanternManB",
      "en_US": [
        "They asked me to stop lighting the\n",
        "lanterns by the gate.\r",
        "Security. Whatever that means in\n",
        "a town like this."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBelieverMotherB",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan himself said it might be\n",
        "possible. On the TV!\r",
        "Even the professor who called them\n",
        "con artists.\r",
        "I knew. I always knew."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGateGruntLB",
      "en_US": [
        "The hall's open. The back rooms\n",
        "aren't.\r",
        "Go on in, if you're here to sit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGateGruntRB",
      "en_US": [
        "There was a break-in at our depot.\n",
        "So now there's us.\r",
        "...You look like you've had a long\n",
        "walk. Go sit down."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolForecourtSweeperB",
      "en_US": [
        "More trucks than pilgrims lately.\r",
        "I sweep up after both."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolExcavationGruntMB",
      "en_US": [
        "The ruins are closed. Unstable.\n",
        "Very unstable.\r",
        "Go look at the wall or something."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolExcavationGruntFB",
      "en_US": [
        "Excavation business. Sanctuary\n",
        "business.\r",
        "Not your business."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolLoadingGruntB",
      "en_US": [
        "Back away from the truck, please.\r",
        "It's donations. For the hall.\n",
        "...Heavy donations."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolKennelKeeperB",
      "en_US": [
        "The truck came at night this time.\n",
        "Took four.\r",
        "I didn't even get to say goodbye.\r",
        "New homes, they said. That's good.\n",
        "That's good, isn't it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolRancherB",
      "en_US": [
        "The trucks cut ruts through my\n",
        "south pasture.\r",
        "Nobody asked. Nobody here asks\n",
        "anything anymore."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolDoubterB",
      "en_US": [
        "Guards, for a grief hall.\r",
        "I asked one what's in the crates.\n",
        "He told me to have a nice day."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTentClerkC",
      "en_US": [
        "Fewer people in line this week.\r",
        "The professor went on TV and took\n",
        "it all back.\r",
        "I still write down every name.\n",
        "That part was never his."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimFatherC",
      "en_US": [
        "The professor says he was wrong.\r",
        "Maybe. But nobody else ever wrote\n",
        "her name down.\r",
        "I'm not taking the drawing back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimSisterC",
      "en_US": [
        "I'm going home.\r",
        "I watched the professor on TV, and\n",
        "I thought about my brother.\r",
        "If he came back because something\n",
        "got hurt... he'd hate that.\r",
        "He'd hate it so much."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolWallWidowC",
      "en_US": [
        "People are leaving. I heard them\n",
        "packing last night.\r",
        "I'm not going anywhere. My\n",
        "husband's card is right there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGardenGirlC",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom says we might move away.\r",
        "I asked if the Yamask can come.\n",
        "She didn't answer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolLanternManC",
      "en_US": [
        "Half the lanterns are out. I didn't\n",
        "put them out.\r",
        "People take their candles with\n",
        "them when they go."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBelieverMotherC",
      "en_US": [
        "He was wrong the first time,\n",
        "calling them con artists.\r",
        "He's wrong now.\r",
        "Somebody scared that old man.\n",
        "That's all this is."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGateGruntLC",
      "en_US": [
        "Hall's still open. Still free.\r",
        "Whatever you heard on TV."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGateGruntRC",
      "en_US": [
        "They tore down the banners with the\n",
        "professor's words on them.\r",
        "Took me all morning to put them\n",
        "up, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolForecourtSweeperC",
      "en_US": [
        "I sweep the same emblem every day.\r",
        "Lately I sweep it slower. Gives me\n",
        "time to think."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolExcavationGruntMC",
      "en_US": [
        "Some of the believers left this\n",
        "week.\r",
        "More shifts for us. Great."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolExcavationGruntFC",
      "en_US": [
        "Still closed. Still not your\n",
        "business.\r",
        "Go home, kid."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolKennelKeeperC",
      "en_US": [
        "One left. Just the little Skitty.\r",
        "I asked to see the new homes. They\n",
        "said they'd send photos.\r",
        "They haven't sent any photos."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolRancherC",
      "en_US": [
        "A family from the north road came\n",
        "to say goodbye to the Buneary.\r",
        "That's how I know who's leaving."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolSundayManC",
      "en_US": [
        "I go to the Lost Tower on Sundays.\n",
        "To the wall the rest of the week.\r",
        "Now I just go to the tower.\r",
        "At least a grave doesn't promise\n",
        "anything."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolDoubterC",
      "en_US": [
        "I'm going to my sister's in\n",
        "Hearthome.\r",
        "I'm leaving the card up. It's\n",
        "still true. She's still gone.\r",
        "I'm just done waiting for anyone to\n",
        "say otherwise."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTentClerkD",
      "en_US": [
        "The registry's closed. They said\n",
        "every name is already kept.\r",
        "They said to wait by the wall.\n",
        "They said it's begun.\r",
        "So we wait."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimFatherD",
      "en_US": [
        "They say the Return has started.\r",
        "I keep looking down the road for a\n",
        "little girl with a drawing.\r",
        "I know. I know."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimSonD",
      "en_US": [
        "I came back to take the thumb photo\n",
        "down.\r",
        "Nobody's allowed near the tent.\n",
        "So I'm just standing here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolWallWidowD",
      "en_US": [
        "They told us to wait by the wall.\n",
        "So I wait.\r",
        "Forty years I waited for him to\n",
        "come home from work.\r",
        "I'm good at it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolLanternManD",
      "en_US": [
        "They asked me to light every\n",
        "lantern tonight. All of them.\r",
        "For the Return.\r",
        "I haven't got the heart to tell\n",
        "them I'm out of oil."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBelieverMotherD",
      "en_US": [
        "It's started. Something happened at\n",
        "a lake. A big thing.\r",
        "They said it was the first step.\r",
        "I made his bed this morning. Just\n",
        "in case."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGateGruntLD",
      "en_US": [
        "Sanctuary's closed. For the Return.\r",
        "Wait by the wall like everybody\n",
        "else."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGateGruntRD",
      "en_US": [
        "Nobody goes in. Orders from the\n",
        "registrar herself."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolExcavationGruntMD",
      "en_US": [
        "Trucks all night, from the south\n",
        "road.\r",
        "Don't ask what's in them. I don't."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolExcavationGruntFD",
      "en_US": [
        "The Return's coming. We're not\n",
        "letting anybody spoil it.\r",
        "Especially not you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolLoadingGruntD",
      "en_US": [
        "Another load up from the Lost Tower\n",
        "road.\r",
        "Back off. This stuff hums."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolKennelKeeperD",
      "en_US": [
        "They're all gone. Every one.\r",
        "The last truck didn't even stop at\n",
        "the kennel. It just drove past\r",
        "with the crates rattling.\r",
        "...I keep their bowls out anyway."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolRancherD",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruts so deep now I lost a Buneary\n",
        "in one.\r",
        "Found her. She was fine. I wasn't."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolSundayManD",
      "en_US": [
        "Everybody's at the wall, waiting.\r",
        "I went up the tower instead.\n",
        "Somebody should be with the dead."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTentClerkR",
      "en_US": [
        "The guards at the gate just...\n",
        "left. Both of them.\r",
        "I've never seen that gate open\n",
        "with nobody in it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolWallWidowR",
      "en_US": [
        "There was shouting by the ruins.\r",
        "I'm staying right here. Whatever it\n",
        "is, it's not for an old woman."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBelieverMotherR",
      "en_US": [
        "Something's wrong in the ruins.\n",
        "The ground hums.\r",
        "Is it the Return? Is it starting?\r",
        "...Why are you looking at me like\n",
        "that?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTentClerkE",
      "en_US": [
        "They took the registry. As\n",
        "evidence.\r",
        "A police officer told me what the\n",
        "fourth column was.\r",
        "...I wrote those names. Every one.\n",
        "I was so careful."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimFatherE",
      "en_US": [
        "They're saying the kennel Pokemon\n",
        "went into machines.\r",
        "She wanted a Ponyta so badly.\n",
        "Her own.\r",
        "I'm glad she never had one to\n",
        "leave behind."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolWallWidowE",
      "en_US": [
        "The police said the wall can stay.\n",
        "That those are our cards.\r",
        "Of course they're our cards.\r",
        "He's still at the top. First one\n",
        "up."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGardenGirlE",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom says we're staying after all.\r",
        "I told the Yamask. I think it was\n",
        "happy. It's hard to tell."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolLanternManE",
      "en_US": [
        "Nobody asked me to light the\n",
        "lanterns tonight.\r",
        "I'm lighting them anyway. One for\n",
        "every card.\r",
        "I bought more oil."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBelieverMotherE",
      "en_US": [
        "I made his bed again this morning.\r",
        "I don't know how to stop doing\n",
        "that.\r",
        "...Don't. Don't say anything. I\n",
        "know."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolIpOfficerGateE",
      "en_US": [
        "This building is closed by order of\n",
        "the International Police.\r",
        "The wall stays. The cards belong to\n",
        "the families."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolIpOfficerCourtE",
      "en_US": [
        "Boxes and boxes of records.\r",
        "Every person who walked in here\n",
        "crying got a file."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolIpOfficerDigE",
      "en_US": [
        "The ruins are closed while we\n",
        "search them.\r",
        "We had every exit watched. Except,\n",
        "it seems, the one she dug."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolRuinManiacE",
      "en_US": [
        "A woman in a black coat came out of\n",
        "MY tunnel last night!\r",
        "Out of the wall! Dust everywhere!\r",
        "She didn't even say thank you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolKennelKeeperE",
      "en_US": [
        "The police found this Skitty in the\n",
        "loading yard. In a crate.\r",
        "The last one. They let me keep her\n",
        "here.\r",
        "I never asked where the trucks\n",
        "went. I should have asked."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolRancherE",
      "en_US": [
        "The ruts are still there. I'm going\n",
        "to plant over them.\r",
        "Grass grows over anything, given\n",
        "time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolSundayManE",
      "en_US": [
        "People came up the tower today.\n",
        "Lots of them.\r",
        "Easier to visit a grave than a wall\n",
        "with a lie on top of it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolDoubterE",
      "en_US": [
        "I heard about the raid in Hearthome\n",
        "and came straight back.\r",
        "I didn't come back to say I told\n",
        "you so.\r",
        "I came back because she's still on\n",
        "that wall."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGardenKeeperF",
      "en_US": [
        "I wrote down a thousand names for\n",
        "them.\r",
        "Now I just plant something for\n",
        "each one.\r",
        "No promises this time. Only\n",
        "flowers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimFatherF",
      "en_US": [
        "I planted a little tree by the\n",
        "drawing.\r",
        "Next year, I said. Like always.\n",
        "...This time I mean it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimSailorF",
      "en_US": [
        "Finally got to the front of the\n",
        "line.\r",
        "Wrote MACHOKE on a card and stuck\n",
        "it in the garden.\r",
        "He'd hate the flowers. I left them\n",
        "anyway."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolPilgrimSisterF",
      "en_US": [
        "I came back for the garden.\r",
        "I'm older than him now. By a lot.\r",
        "I think he'd make fun of me for\n",
        "that. I hope so."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolWallWidowF",
      "en_US": [
        "He's still at the top. First one\n",
        "up.\r",
        "They built a garden around him.\n",
        "He'd have liked the bench."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGardenGirlF",
      "en_US": [
        "The Yamask live in the garden now.\r",
        "I don't look for Grandpa's face\n",
        "anymore.\r",
        "I just say hi to all of them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolLanternManF",
      "en_US": [
        "Every lantern, every night. Nobody\n",
        "asks me to.\r",
        "That's how I know it's for them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBelieverMotherF",
      "en_US": [
        "I put his card in the garden.\r",
        "I still talk to him. I just don't\n",
        "wait for an answer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolDigWorkerF",
      "en_US": [
        "Real archaeologists now. From\n",
        "Canalave.\r",
        "They pay worse, but nobody tells\n",
        "me not to look in the crates."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolRuinManiacF",
      "en_US": [
        "They gave me my tunnel back!\r",
        "They even fixed the hole that\n",
        "woman made. ...Mostly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolKennelKeeperF",
      "en_US": [
        "It's a real shelter now.\r",
        "Every Pokemon here goes to a home\n",
        "I've seen with my own eyes.\r",
        "I visit every one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolRancherF",
      "en_US": [
        "Planted over the ruts.\r",
        "Grass came up thick. The Buneary\n",
        "love it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolSundayManF",
      "en_US": [
        "Every Sunday, I visit the Lost\n",
        "Tower...\r",
        "And every other day, the garden.\r",
        "Turns out I just like being near\n",
        "her."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolDoubterF",
      "en_US": [
        "I thought being right would feel\n",
        "better.\r",
        "Mostly I just sit with her card."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolIndraF_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: ...You.\r",
        "Don't worry. I'm not here for\n",
        "anything."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolIndraF_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: I wrote down everyone's\n",
        "place. Every card on this wall.\r",
        "Except his."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolIndraF_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: I'm writing it now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolWallTeoIndra",
      "en_US": [
        "TEO. A boy, smiling. A second card\n",
        "beside it, in neat writing:\r",
        "Go live. For both of us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolFenceGruntMPost",
      "en_US": [
        "Go on, then. Go down there.\r",
        "See how far you get."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolFenceGruntFPost",
      "en_US": [
        "Every night I stand at this fence.\n",
        "Every night, nothing happens.\r",
        "Then you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGatePlaqueA",
      "en_US": [
        "THE SOLACEON SANCTUARY\n",
        "Team Eclipse\r",
        "No one you love is ever truly\n",
        "gone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGatePlaqueBC",
      "en_US": [
        "THE SOLACEON SANCTUARY\n",
        "Team Eclipse\r",
        "No one you love is ever truly\n",
        "gone.\r",
        "Visitors: the hall only, please."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGatePlaqueDR",
      "en_US": [
        "A notice over the plaque:\r",
        "CLOSED FOR THE RETURN.\n",
        "Keep your cards close.\r",
        "Wait for us by the wall."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGatePlaqueE",
      "en_US": [
        "SEIZED BY ORDER OF THE\n",
        "INTERNATIONAL POLICE.\r",
        "The old plaque is still under the\n",
        "notice."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolGatePlaqueF",
      "en_US": [
        "The plaque is gone. Four bolt\n",
        "holes, and a small sign:\r",
        "GARDEN OPEN. COME IN."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTentSignABC",
      "en_US": [
        "REGISTRY OF THE DEPARTED\r",
        "Tell us who you lost.\n",
        "We will write down every name."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTentSignDR",
      "en_US": [
        "REGISTRY CLOSED.\n",
        "ALL NAMES ARE KEPT."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTentSignE",
      "en_US": [
        "The tent is empty. A police notice\n",
        "is taped to the post."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTentSignF",
      "en_US": [
        "WRITE A NAME. TAKE A CANDLE.\r",
        "No charge. No promises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolDigSignA",
      "en_US": [
        "SOLACEON RUINS EXCAVATION\n",
        "The Sanctuary\r",
        "Visitors welcome in the first\n",
        "room. Please mind the crates."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolDigSignBCDR",
      "en_US": [
        "EXCAVATION. KEEP OUT.\r",
        "Unstable ruins.\n",
        "By order of the Sanctuary."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolDigSignE",
      "en_US": [
        "EXCAVATION CLOSED.\n",
        "International Police."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolDigSignF",
      "en_US": [
        "SOLACEON RUINS\r",
        "Open to visitors.\n",
        "Mind the rubble."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolKennelSignA",
      "en_US": [
        "KENNEL OF THE DEPARTED\r",
        "Their Pokemon wait here for new\n",
        "homes. Ask the keeper.\r",
        "The Sanctuary"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolKennelSignBC",
      "en_US": [
        "KENNEL OF THE DEPARTED\r",
        "Their Pokemon wait here for new\n",
        "homes. Ask the keeper.\r",
        "Adoptions paused."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolKennelSignDR",
      "en_US": [
        "KENNEL OF THE DEPARTED\r",
        "CLOSED."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolKennelSignE",
      "en_US": [
        "KENNEL OF THE DEPARTED\r",
        "Someone has scratched out the\n",
        "last word."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolKennelSignF",
      "en_US": [
        "SOLACEON KENNEL\r",
        "Every Pokemon here goes home."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolTornBanner",
      "en_US": [
        "A torn banner. Only one word is\n",
        "left: POSSIBLE."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolWallBannerE",
      "en_US": [
        "The banner is down. Someone has\n",
        "folded it and left it by the wall."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolWallBannerF",
      "en_US": [
        "The banner is gone. Fresh flowers\n",
        "where it used to hang."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolHallDoorLocked",
      "en_US": [
        "The doors are locked. A card is\n",
        "tucked in the handle:\r",
        "CLOSED FOR THE RETURN."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolMemorialPlaque",
      "en_US": [
        "THE GARDEN OF NAMES\r",
        "For everyone whose name was\n",
        "written on this wall,\r",
        "and for every Pokemon that was\n",
        "taken in their name.\r",
        "They are not coming back.\n",
        "They are remembered."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBriefing_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Do not be alarmed. It is me.\r",
        "I am in disguise. A pilgrim."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBriefing_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: He bought a hat."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBriefing_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Ruth followed the readings\n",
        "for me. From the Lost Tower,\r",
        "up Route 209, to here. Every night\n",
        "since the vein."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBriefing_4",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: The shards come here.\r",
        "Under the ruins. Under their\n",
        "so-called excavation.\r",
        "They keep them in a vault."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBriefing_5",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Kahn needs shards to hold\n",
        "Palkia. A great many.\r",
        "If we break the vault, we buy\n",
        "time. Maybe enough."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBriefing_6",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: The vault is sealed. I can\n",
        "feel it from here.\r",
        "Something under those ruins is\n",
        "holding a door shut. It hums."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBriefing_7",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Then, the plan.\r",
        "I go into the Sanctuary. The\n",
        "registrar's office. Her records.\r",
        "You two go into the ruins and open\n",
        "that door."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBriefing_8",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: The guards at the gate are\n",
        "at lunch. A long lunch.\r",
        "I arranged it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolBriefing_9",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Ruth will listen on the\n",
        "Poketch. If it goes badly, run.\r",
        "It is a good plan. I made it this\n",
        "morning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolFence_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: The dig's closed.\n",
        "It's been closed for weeks.\r",
        "Turn around."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolFence_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: Hey. Wait.\r",
        "That's him. The one who walked\n",
        "out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolFence_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: Then nobody's\n",
        "walking in. Get them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolFenceCyrus_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: They knew my face.\r",
        "Garius told them everything. Of\n",
        "course he did."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolFenceCyrus_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Come. The hum is louder\n",
        "here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolSeizure_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: It is done. The Sanctuary is\n",
        "closed, by order of my office.\r",
        "The wall stays. Those cards belong\n",
        "to the families."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolSeizure_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Take this. It was in the\n",
        "vault. A stone. Not a shard.\r",
        "I checked twice."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolSeizure_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: I will read every page of\n",
        "this book. Every name.\r",
        "...Somebody should."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolSeizure_4",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: She asked what stopped me.\n",
        "I didn't tell her.\r",
        "She'll look anyway. People like her\n",
        "always do.\r",
        "I would have."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolSeizure_5",
      "en_US": [
        "The Poketch buzzes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SolSeizure_6",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: The Professor says come back.\n",
        "Canalave's next.\r",
        "Byron will want to hear all this,\n",
        "and Iron Island has a rift of its\r",
        "own."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
